  - required-bound heads, flat calls and malformed heads;
  - the negation refusals;
  - a divergent rule exhausting a bounded call structurally at 50, 500 and 5000 steps;
  - the adapter's `:step-budget-exhausted`, first-witness stop and the exact-allowance boundary.
